# playpick gave battleground/escort (The Long Haul), mage:frost, wander,
# fresh save, 390x844 touch. Direction.md's [[#7]] has exactly one prior
# `wander` pull on this map (2026-09-28-19, priest:discipline, carried) and it
# never reached a result screen (still ongoing at 154.3s of the 300s cap) --
# this is the second ever, the first on a fresh save, the first non-healer,
# and the first on a narrow phone viewport. Starting at the front page since
# there is no invite hash into a battleground.
open
targets
ui
shot front

tap battleground
targets
ui
shot bgsetup

tap map:escort
targets
shot classpick

tap class:mage:frost
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
targets
shot pulled

# Three checked segments rather than one long blind one, so a death or a
# result screen shows up in the journal close to when it actually happened.
play wander 100
bill
state
shot mid1

play wander 100
bill
state
shot mid2

play wander 100
bill
says
state
targets
shot mid3
